    "idea": "Pitch-dark rotating Planetarium dome hub teasing the N Boss Door, E Key-1 door, and 3 shortcut balconies; shoot twin star nodes to bridge onto the central rotor and ring the Star Bell 90 degrees to swing the West Star-Bridge and unlock the West Wing.",
